---
railroad-ebnf-beta
accTitle: Four artifact definitions for controlled skill evaluation
accDescr: Four railroad productions define the model as its implementation, decoding policy, and context limits; the agent harness as its loop, tools, memory, parser, recovery, and context policy; the skill as SKILL.md plus instructions and optional scripts, references, and assets; and the evaluation harness as tasks, runner, environments, graders, logs, and aggregation.
model = ( "model weights" | "fixed model API" ), "decoding policy", "context limits" ;
agent_harness = "control loop", "tools", "memory", "parser", "recovery policy", "context policy" ;
skill = "SKILL.md", "instructions", [ "scripts" ], [ "references" ], [ "assets" ] ;
evaluation_harness = "tasks", "runner", "environments", "graders", "logs", "aggregation" ;
